{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Baka and Test - Summon the Beasts: Matsuri","Continuing where season 1 left off, everyone in Class F is bemoaning the horrible equipment they have. There is a school festival going on though, and if they make enough money they'll be able to buy better school supplies, and as always Akihisa is ready to do anything that might help out Himeji. This is especially important though, because Himeji's father is worried about her placement in Class F and is thinking about transferring her to another school. \n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["バカとテストと召喚獣 ～祭～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":6347,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":8516,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-9471","ids":{"shikimori":9471,"mal":9471,"anilist":9471,"kodik":"serial-26124"},"kodikIds":["serial-36430","serial-20745","serial-22231","serial-30478","serial-26124"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-36430":"2021-08-09T20:05:56Z","serial-20745":"2020-01-05T22:06:08Z","serial-22231":"2020-02-02T14:30:07Z","serial-30478":"2020-12-17T13:58:56Z","serial-26124":"2020-05-26T06:04:57Z"},"title":"Дурни, тесты, аватары: Фестиваль","originalTitle":"Baka to Test to Shoukanjuu: Matsuri","alt":"Дурак, тест и призванные существа: Фестиваль / Балбес, тесты и призванные существа Baka and Test - Summon the Beasts: Matsuri バカとテストと召喚獣 ～祭～","description":"Данная история заполняет пробел между первым и вторым сезоном. В ней мы увидим, как ребята участвуют в школьном фестивале, чтобы заработать денег и отремонтировать класс.","year":2011,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","Школа","супер сила"],"rating":7.55,"popularity":28358,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[6347,8516],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/9471/e0b486a9dc7fdc9ebe42b4c48927d924.jpeg","width":310,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9471-f2s9Ph2iFnfN.jpg","width":1720,"height":500}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"nu